   https://www.tensorflow.org/tutorials/load_data/tfrecord#reading_a_tfrecord_file)
   - [Parse (deserialize) examples](
   https://www.tensorflow.org/tutorials/load_data/tfrecord#reading_a_tfrecord_file)

  A minimal example is given below:

